        <div class="itq-answer" id="itqAns1">
          <h4>Warm‑up Reference Answer (Conceptual)</h4>
          <p>Reference CompareTo implementation (key points):
- If other is null: return 1 (current comes after null).
- Compare Priority first (ascending): Priority.CompareTo(other.Priority).
- If equal: compare CreatedAt (ascending): CreatedAt.CompareTo(other.CreatedAt).
- If equal: compare TicketId (ordinal): string.Compare(TicketId, other.TicketId, StringComparison.Ordinal).
- Return first non-zero result; otherwise return 0.

This ensures deterministic sorting when multiple fields are equal.</p>
