- Order.CompareTo(Order? other) (default sorting)
- OrderComparers.ByCustomerNameThenDefault() -&gt; IComparer&lt;Order&gt;

Rules:
- CompareTo implements default rule (Urgent DESC, DeliveryDate ASC, Amount DESC, OrderNo ASC)
- Custom comparer sorts CustomerName ASC (ignore case) then falls back to CompareTo for rest
- Use Comparer&lt;Order&gt;.Create(...) or implement IComparer&lt;Order&gt;

